    "paywall.freeChapters" : {
      "comment" : "Paywall: what the full access is and how to get it. %@ is the list of free chapters in numerals, e.g. « I, II et III ». COMMERCIAL: the chapters named here are free permanently — the sentence must not suggest a trial or a limited time.",
